id=audio_policy_fix
name=Dolby Spatializer Fix [Pong ATMOS]
version=v2.0
versionCode=200
author=deadrator
description=Registers Pong's dedicated libswspatializer effect and exposes a Bluetooth A2DP spatializer output on Poco M5 (rock/stone), Android 16. The framework sends multichannel PCM to Dolby's renderer, which produces binaural stereo for TWS.
